{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sokoku</strong> is a block-pushing game with a twist: you not only push blocks, you <i>are</i> one. Specifically, you are a die that rolls over itself, changing its top face with every move. You'll need to plan your path carefully so that all numbers end where they have to, including the one on top of yourself, while you interact with all kinds of cubes and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579700/extras/move_demo.gif?t=1745565081\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of puzzles will test your logic, patience, and spatial thinking. Can you roll your way to the solution?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rolling in","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3579700/819deea8b3045ed4295632fe19e42802391aa517.jpg"},{"name":"That's how I roll","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3579700/324539ea54c8d83f11e3598ab203c0d39fb6be50.jpg"},{"name":"Rock & roll","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3579700/f9c4905d07e1a38d7a742df1ee3545970388a953.jpg"},{"name":"Dicey rolls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3579700/d594a6cf93cbfcf40bb3e23bb5ee72abaeb82b64.jpg"},{"name":"A rolling stone gathers no moss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3579700/ebf086f511155fe26046156b52c8430a71a96c4f.jpg"},{"name":"Rolling out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3579700/f7e355e5cd8244f07d7cf3ee6e892314b5ab95bf.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579700?t=1745565081","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579700?t=17455650